OL,3,GNEWSAPM would consider independence
OL,4,Areferendum if 'clear consensus' emerges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has suggested
OL,7,Fanother Scottish independence
OL,8,Freferendum could be held - if public
OL,9,Fopinion shows demand for one.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham previously told First
OL,12,FMinister John Swinney that a second
OL,13,Freferendum was "off limits".
OL,15,FBut, speaking at Prime Minister's
OL,16,FQuestions, Burnham appeared to indicate
OL,17,Fa vote could be held if there was clear
OL,18,Fpublic support, comparing the situation
OL,19,Fto the conditions for a border poll in
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
