OL,3,GNEWSAPM would consider independence
OL,4,Areferendum if 'clear consensus' emerges
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney said it was the first time
OL,7,Fsince 2014 that a prime minister had
OL,8,F"accepted that majority support for a
OL,9,Freferendum should mean one takes
OL,10,Fplace."
